# =============================================================================
# .gitignore — Securing AI Agents, MCP & RAG in Production
# Allow-list style: a NEW internal .md (report/QA/notes) is ignored by default;
# everything the labs actually need is explicitly kept.
# =============================================================================

# --- Python ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
env/

# --- Editors / OS ---
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- Secrets & local env (labs read OPENAI_API_KEY / ANTHROPIC_API_KEY from env) ---
.env
.env.*
*.key
secrets/

# --- Lab runtime artifacts (generated when a lab runs) ---
trace.jsonl
*.log

# --- Slide decks & binaries (distributed separately, never in the code repo) ---
*.pptx
*.pptm
*.potx
*.ppt

# --- Internal, non-student-facing markdown -----------------------------------
# Reports, QA docs, notes, this course's own review artifacts. Allow-list the
# student-facing docs (and the lab DATA that happens to be markdown) so they
# are always tracked, and let any other/new .md fall through to ignored.
*.md
!README.md
!README-Codespace.md
!LICENSE.md
!labs.md
!.github/copilot-instructions.md
!bonus-claudecode/README-bonus.md
# Lab DATA that is markdown and is REQUIRED at runtime:
!rag/docs/*.md
!codingagent/sample_repo/*.md

# --- Scratch / staging dirs ---
_*/
